WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.590
It starts with you. Pick a thing, type the
name you want on it, and order.

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:10.130
Nothing sits in a box waiting. We only
start once your order comes in.

3
00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:15.140
Samuel loads the filament and sets it
printing, one thin layer at a time.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.120
Every piece comes off the plate
and gets checked by hand.

5
00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:24.140
Then it's posted anywhere in the UK, or
you collect it from Great Sankey.

6
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.500
Allow seven days. swizee.co.uk
